@Ecommerce_HostAddress = http://localhost:5109                                             
                                                                                               
### 1. Get All Jerseys (Check existing items)                                              
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys                                                  
Accept: application/json                                                                   
                                                                                               
### 2. Create a Valid Jersey (Real Madrid Home Kit)                                        
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys                                                 
Content-Type: application/json                                                             
                                                                                               
{                                                                                          
    "name": "Real Madrid 24/25 Home Kit",                                                    
    "club": "Real Madrid",                                                                   
    "description": "Authentic player edition jersey with gold details",                      
    "imageUrls": [                                                                           
    "https://example.com/realmadrid-front.jpg"                                             
    ],                                                                                       
    "price": 1500.00,                                                                        
    "stockQuantity": 25                                                                      
}                                                                                          
                                                                                               
### 3. Test FluentValidation: Create an INVALID Jersey (Negative price & empty name)       
POST {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys                                                 
Content-Type: application/json                                                             
                                                                                               
{                                                                                          
    "name": "",                                                                              
    "club": "Barcelona",                                                                     
    "description": "Test kit",                                                               
    "imageUrls": [],                                                                         
    "price": -500.00,                                                                        
    "stockQuantity": -5                                                                      
}           


### 4. Get Jersey By ID (Replace with an ID from Step 2)                                                      
@sampleJerseyId = 6cd934ab-5cce-4b49-a62c-bb4398939013
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys/{{sampleJerseyId}}
Content-Type: application/json                                
                                                          
### 5. Get Jersey By Non-Existent ID (Expect 404 NotFound)                                                  
GET {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys/b1f6d808-9c4a-4e31-baa1-672dceefb7cf                        
Accept: application/json     


### 6. Patch / Update Only the Price (e.g. 1850 BDT)  
PATCH {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys/{{sampleJerseyId}}
Content-Type: application/json                        
                                                          
{                                                     
    "price": 1850.00                                    
}                                                     
                                                          
### 7. Patch / Update Price AND Stock                 
PATCH {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys/{{sampleJerseyId}}
Content-Type: application/json                        
                                                          
{                                                     
    "price": 2100.00,                                   
    "stockQuantity": 50                                 
}                                                     
                                                          
### 8. Patch with Invalid Data (Expect 400 Validation Error)                                                  
PATCH {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys/{{sampleJerseyId}}
Content-Type: application/json                        
                                                          
{                                                     
    "price": -100.00                                    
}   

### 8. Delete a Jersey By ID (Returns 204 No Content!)                                     
DELETE {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys/6b3628b4-e76f-4fc7-9ed9-44492cfc6da9                   
                                                                                               
### 9. Delete with Fake ID (Tests 404 Not Found!)                                          
DELETE {{Ecommerce_HostAddress}}/api/jerseys/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000